        <p>pITTS'S DINING-ROOM SUITES (Second,hand), Magnifizent Solid Walnut Suite in rich Oriental saddle- bags, with velvet borders, divan couch, and elegant easy and small chairs, cost £3O for £.13; massive spoonback Suite,verV fine heavy frames, in rot skins, cost £35 for £l5 ; grand solid Oak Suite, frame exceptionally heavy and elaboratively carved, very uncommon design, cost £4O for £l7 ; another similar, in Walnut, £lB. Two hundred to select from. PITTS'S DINING TABLES (Second-hand).-- solid Brown Ash Table, with oval leaves. cost 35s . for 16s. : solid Brown Ash Extending Table. cost £2 for 253. ; another larger cost £3. for.3ss. ; splendid solid Oak Table, exteneing frame. beautifully figured wood, heavy massive legs, Bft. cost £lO, for £5 lOs ; another 12ft. cost £l2. for £9; su aatantial Dining Table. with pine top and extending screw, cost £3, for 25s ; innumerable Awes, all sizes and designs, in oak, mahogany, and walnut, at exceptionally low prices, up to £5O each ; grand value,</p>
