        <p>DITTT'S DRAWING-ROOM SUITES (Second- band).—Artistic Chippendale Suite. Oriental covering, cost £l2, for ES 105 ; Inlaid Mahogany Suite, covered in silk cost EIS. for £9, Chippen.iale Suite, expensive choice silk covering. cost .E2O, for £lO 10s ; exquisite Inlaid Rosewood Suite. of choiCe character, latest design, beautifully covered In silk tapestry, cost £25, for £l4 ; elegant Louis XV Suite In dark Chippendale Mahogany, beautifully covered. cost £35, for £l9. Over a hundred Suites to select from, at all Prices up to £4O each.</p>
        <p>PITTS'S DRAWING-ROOM CABINE:S (Sacond- hani).—Solid Walnut Cabinbt, w,th carved panels and bevelled plates, cost £5 10s, for £3 ; nicely figured Walnut Cabinet, with marble slab and plate-glass back, Cost £.7, for £8 ; elegant Chippendale Cabinet, cost £l5 for £7 20s; splendid inlaid Rosewood French Cabinet, beautiful design. cost £BO, for £8 16, ; exquisite inlaid Rosewood Cabinet, exceptionally choice design ; would grace any drawing room, cost £3O. ior £l5. Scores of others to select from, up to £,.1 each.</p>
        <p>PITTS'S BEDROOM FURNITURE (Second-hand) Elegant Bedroom Butte, landscape pattern carved panels and bevelled plates, cost £lB. to- £lO ; tasteful Suite In walnut, finely designed wardrobe with bevelled mirrors, everything complete, la•ge-sizid stands and tables, pedestal, tail, chairs, cost £3O, for £l5 ; magnificent Suite in full number of articles, all large, of best workmanship and design, cost £4O, for £lB ; another similar, cost £5O, for £24. A hundred ethers, up to £9O each. Overrnantela in infinite variety. Must be promptly cleared out irrespective of profit.</p>
