      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1901-10-18_WidnesExaminer_art0007" n="art0007">
        <head>MOST NUTRITIOUZ.</head>
        <p>THE MOST NUTRITIOUZ.</p>
        <p>E P PS'S</p>
