        <p>Stockport v. St. Helens. At Stockport, betore 3,000 spectators. During the first half St3ekport was slently the better team, and Forargue sawed, Orarn tailing at goal. On changing cads some (act play was seen, but nothing further was soured. Result :—Stcekport one try (3 points) ; Sc. Helens nil.</p>
